	<strings name="main_menu/settings_select/player_setup/player_profile_edit/mods_settings/prism/help_strings">
		<string text=""/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Remodel draws the level's rock, sand and Forerunner walls from a denser model in the data folder; none comes with the game, and a level without one is drawn as Xbox. You still walk and collide on the original."/>
		<string text="How far out the remodel is drawn in its full detail; beyond, its lighter far level. Low is cheaper on the graphics card."/>
		<string text="The shape Classic's sun shadows are cast from with the remodel: Far, its lighter level (the rock's ledges still shade); Full, every detail; Xbox, the map's own (cheapest)."/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="A soft glow about light brighter than white: plasma, the sun, lights and blasts. The Xbox had none; Glow is faint, Full wider. Nothing lit only to white glows. With any lighting."/>
		<string text="Grades the finished picture by the light around each pixel: deeper local contrast, dark places lifted, richer colour. Off draws it as the game does; Vivid goes further. With any lighting."/>
	</strings>
